# Four semicircular humps on one side, with short leads into the first and out of the last.
kind inductor
convention A coil of four humps, shorter than its leads' span.
check coil
pin 1 0 -100
pin 2 0 100
line 0 -100 0 -80
arc 0 -60 20 -90 180
arc 0 -20 20 -90 180
arc 0 20 20 -90 180
arc 0 60 20 -90 180
line 0 80 0 100
